# Custom DIRECT rules
#
# These rules are injected after the upstream REJECT rules and before
# FINAL,PROXY. This preserves upstream ad blocking while routing the selected
# services directly.

# Apple Push Notification service (APNs)
# Apple documents *.push.apple.com and the following IPv4 ranges for APNs.
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,push.apple.com,DIRECT
IP-CIDR,17.249.0.0/16,DIRECT,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,17.252.0.0/16,DIRECT,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,17.57.144.0/22,DIRECT,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,17.188.128.0/18,DIRECT,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,17.188.20.0/23,DIRECT,no-resolve

